SUMMARY:June 3 MIH Rehearsal at Mission
DESCRIPTION:Men in Harmony\n**Trial Rehearsal in new place!-** ***Stay tun
 ed for updates!***\nMission Cancer Center\, 21 Hospital Drive. NOT the mai
 n Hospital!\n**Entrance to building parking is** on the Right side of the 
 building as shown in pic. Behind the building on the **immediate LEFT** is
  Hamiton Street where the BIG Parking lot is located. Come into the buildi
 ng **on the floor level**\, into the lobby and there is a corridor towards
  on the right where the conference rooms are. **We'll be rehearsing in con
 ference room R122.**\n**NOTE: Please be on time as the outer doors will be
  locked after we start rehearsal.**
