SUMMARY:AVL Tourists Ball Game
DESCRIPTION:Men in Harmony\nCome hear Men and Harmony as we 'take you out 
 to the ball game'!\nBe there in time to honor our Flag and sing the Nation
 al Anthem **with us!**\nSee what we look like from our May sing! at link b
 elow\n[May 9th Tourist National Anthem](https://www.facebook.com/reel/1343
 425864312568)
