SUMMARY:Come sing A cappella with Us!
DESCRIPTION:Men in Harmony\nHarmonize your 2026 with a dive into the world
  of music with Men in Harmony at our a cappella vocal workshops. Explore y
 our vocal abilities by joining us for an interactive session that covers v
 ocal training\, a cappella techniques\, and group singing tips. Our experi
 enced director will guide you through the basics of harmonizing\, breath c
 ontrol\, and performance skills. Get ready to discover the joy of making m
 usic together in a supportive environment. Come join us for an evening of 
 fun songs and tags!
